  {
    "id": 1,
    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Developing Platform Scope**\n\nI'm currently focused on defining the project's initial scope: a study planning and control platform for public exams (\"concursos públicos\"). I've solidified the need for restricted access via login and password to protect user data. I'm prioritizing the basic pages: a Home dashboard and a Subjects section.\n\n\n**Expanding Feature Set**\n\nI've been expanding the feature set. I'm focusing on \"Cycles,\" \"Review,\" and \"Mock Exams\" sections to complement the core home and subject pages. I'm thinking of AI integration (Gemini) for study cycle generation. I've got spaced repetition alerts (7, 15, and 30 days) planned for reviews. I'm also planning to use performance statistics for Mock Exams.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
    },
