      "text": "**Analyzing Component Enhancements**\n\nI'm now focusing on enhancing the `Disciplinas.tsx` component. I'm thinking of adding fields within each topic for study hours (hours/minutes), attempted questions, correct answers, and a quick view of the performance data. I'm exploring ways to integrate these elements seamlessly and without compromising the user experience.\n\n\n**Refining Interface Specifications**\n\nI'm now revising the interface definition in `types.ts`, incorporating `studyTimeMinutes`, `questionsTotal`, and `questionsCorrect` into the `Topic` interface. My next steps are updating `Disciplinas.tsx` to handle input for these new fields and display the hit rate percentage effectively. The goal is a PhD-level user experience, vertically integrated with the existing style.\n\n\n",
