      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Analyzing Topic Metrics**\n\nOkay, I'm focusing on the \"Disciplinas\" page and how to improve the topic metrics section. Currently, it tracks study time, questions attempted, and questions answered correctly. I am considering ways to expand this. What are the best ways to present that information?\n\n\n**Implementing Date Selection**\n\nI'm now incorporating a manual date selection for study activities. I'm adding a date input element and a calendar icon to the \"Stats Editing Panel\" in `Disciplinas.tsx`. The goal is to allow users to manually specify the \"Study Date\". The current `Topic` interface in `types.ts` has a field `lastStudiedAt`, which I will utilize to store the selected date. This replaces the automatic setting of the date on completion.\n\n\n",
