      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Visualizing Quick Progress**\n\nI'm focusing on adding a quick, discrete progress visualization to the subject cards on the \"Disciplinas\" page. Currently, each card displays a color bar. I am considering different ways of displaying progress, such as filling the color bar, but I have not decided on a final look and feel. I am referencing `Disciplinas.tsx`, which manages both the subject and topic data.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
