      "text": "**Refining Interface Elements**\n\nI'm currently focused on refining the user interface. I need to fix the weekly goal circular chart, it's currently appearing truncated. Furthermore, I'm working on the \"Aproveitamento\" (Performance/Efficiency) section, aiming for activation and overall improvement.\n\n\n**Updating Performance Metrics**\n\nI've been working on the performance card. I've updated the logic to include questions attempted and correct from subjects, topics (studies and revisions), and mocks, calculating the overall average score more accurately. The user wants the count of questions attempted displayed there too. Also, I'm adjusting the Weekly Goal chart, the SVG circle radius will be reduced to eliminate the clipping.\n\n\n",
