      "text": "**Implementing Dark Mode Toggle**\n\nI'm currently focused on incorporating a dark mode toggle into the application. My immediate task involves updating `App.tsx` to manage the dark mode state and integrating the toggle button. From there, I'll update the rest of the components such as `Dashboard.tsx`, `Disciplinas.tsx`, `Ciclos.tsx`, `Revisao.tsx`, and `Simulados.tsx`.\n\n\n**Verifying Dark Mode Implementation**\n\nI've just finished a quick verification pass through the components. All components (`App.tsx`, `Dashboard.tsx`, etc.) are indeed lacking dark mode styling, as expected. This confirms the initial implementation plan. I'm now ready to start implementing the dark mode as outlined.\n\n\n",
