    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Defining Admin Profile Scope**\n\nI'm currently focused on defining the scope of the \"Administrator Profile.\" First on my list is the ability to view active and inactive users. In this client-side app, \"active\" users are those whose data is currently saved in local storage. Next step: What other functions should the admin have?\n\n\n**Developing Admin Functionality**\n\nI'm now diving into the user experience, specifically adding \"Edital Management\" functionality for administrators. I'm focusing on CRUD operations for predefined syllabuses, making sure to include a distinct Admin Dashboard. The user will have a dedicated import button on the disciplinas page. Updated types and components will be needed, too.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
