  {
    "id": 87,
    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "To enhance the **StudyFlow** platform with user management, profile editing, and administrative control, I will implement a robust authentication and profile system.\n\n### Specification of Updates:\n\n1.  **Identity Hub (Login & Register):**\n    *   The `Login.tsx` component now features a \"Switch Mode\" between **Login** and **Register**.\n    *   **Validation:** Real-time feedback for password matching during registration.\n    *   **Persistence:** All users are stored in the `global_users` collection in `localStorage`.\n\n2.  **Self-Service Profile (`Profile.tsx`):**\n    *   A new accessible modal from the sidebar allowing students to update their name, e-mail, and password.\n    *   **Security:** Password changes require a \"New Password\" and \"Confirm Password\" check.\n    *   **Account Deletion:** A \"Danger Zone\" section to permanently remove the account and all associated study data.\n\n3.  **Command Center (Admin Enhancements):**\n    *   The `Admin.tsx` component is now fully CRUD-capable. Admins can manually **Create**, **Edit**, or **Delete** users.\n    *   **User Reset:** Admins can reset a student's password if they are locked out.\n\n4.  **Refined Visual Experience:**\n    *   **Interactive Modals:** Use of backdrop blurs and zoom-in animations.\n    *   **Safety First:** Destructive actions (like deleting an account) feature high-contrast warning modals.\n\n---\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
    },
    "createdTimestamp": {
      "seconds": 1769114181,
      "nanos": 853000000
    },
    "doneTimestamp": {
      "seconds": 1769114182,
      "nanos": 72000000
    }
