ates. It's imperative that the use of icons complements the labels, not replaces them, for all users.\n\n\n**Assessing Button Accessibility**\n\nI'm now evaluating the accessibility and styling of the submit button in `components/Login.tsx`. I'm verifying the contrast ratio to ensure readability, the inclusion of a meaningful label (currently relying on the icon), and the focus state for keyboard navigation. I'll make sure the button provides clear visual feedback upon interaction. I also need to make sure the icon is not the *only* semantic cue, because it must also be understood when the image cannot be loaded.\n\n\n",
