      "text": "**Refining Login Feedback**\n\nI'm currently focused on enhancing user feedback within StudyFlow's login and registration. Specifically, I am zeroing in on password error alerts. I need to make the feedback clear and direct, guiding users seamlessly through the process.\n\n\n**Implementing Security Measures**\n\nI'm now integrating robust brute force protection. After five failed password attempts, a user will be blocked. I'm also adding a \"User not found\" alert, prompting registration for unrecognized emails. Finally, new registrations will default to a visitor profile with limited access to the initial page. I'm updating login.tsx to include state for failed attempts per email and handle the checks. Simultaneously, App.tsx is being updated to manage the new visitor role in the navigation logic.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
    },
