    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Re-implementing Edit Buttons**\n\nI'm focused on restoring the edit buttons within `Disciplinas.tsx`. The goal is to bring back the functionality removed in past changes, specifically for subjects and topics. I need to re-integrate the edit buttons, ensuring they function as intended. I'm reviewing the existing codebase to ensure seamless restoration.\n\n\n",
