      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Re-enabling Registration Buttons**\n\nI'm currently focused on restoring the study log registration buttons within the `Disciplinas.tsx` component. I've pinpointed that these buttons are absent from the current version. Right now, I'm checking the older versions for code to use.\n\n\n**Adding the Missing Log Button**\n\nI've successfully re-added the edit buttons in `Disciplinas.tsx`, but overlooked the log button that triggers `onAddLog`. My current focus is integrating a study log recording button beside each topic's name. I'm aiming for a concise input method (a sub-form or modal) for the minutes, topic ID, and subject ID. I see the function `onAddLog` takes those as parameters. I believe this will be a visual button in each topic row.\n\n\n",
