onment Configuration**\n\nI'm now revising my approach to address the Supabase connection. I'll correct the environment variable assignments in `lib/supabase.ts`, using `SUPABASE_URL` and `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` as intended. I'll also eliminate the `<script type=\"importmap\">` tag in `index.html` to prevent any potential conflicts. Additionally, I'll advise the user on setting the environment variables in Vercel or their `.env` file to ensure the connection is correctly configured. Finally, I'll ensure `metadata.json` doesn't need to be updated.\n\n\n",
