    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Considering Authentication Simplification**\n\nI'm currently focused on streamlining authentication. The email confirmation step is proving to be a bottleneck, causing delays. I am now exploring client-side modifications within Supabase to effectively bypass this default requirement.\n\n\n**Refining Authentication Flow**\n\nI've realized I can't directly disable email confirmation via code; that's a Supabase Dashboard setting. My priority shifts to improving the user experience and suggesting workarounds. I'll update the UI to de-emphasize email verification. I also plan to add messages recommending users disable \"Confirm Email\" in Supabase for a smoother experience. I'm exploring a seamless login immediately after registration and, most importantly, explaining confirmation requirements within the registration flow itself, or highlighting SQL helper if needed.\n\n\n**Implementing Immediate Sessions**\n\nI'm now focusing on directly implementing immediate sessions after signup. My plan involves modifying `Login.tsx` to handle the `data.session` immediately following `signUp`. I'll also update the UI to stop prompting for confirmation. Keeping the SQL hack is still essential.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
    },
