      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Restoring Editing Functionality**\n\nI'm focused on restoring the ability to easily edit subject and topic names, including bringing back the delete buttons. This will allow for more dynamic control, and I'm prioritizing ease of use, considering prior interface designs. My approach considers the previous iteration of features for an effective restoration.\n\n\n**Refining Editing Implementation**\n\nI'm now implementing inline editing and individual delete buttons. I am focusing on making the delete buttons work and ensuring that subject names and topic titles are editable in both Disciplinas.tsx and Admin.tsx. I am considering double-click or edit icons for this functionality to streamline the user experience, while also ensuring bulk and manual edits can coexist. Specifically, I'm integrating state variables to facilitate renaming subjects and topics.\n\n\n",
