  {
    "id": 336,
    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Tracking Topic Progress**\n\nI'm focusing on incorporating a detailed tracking system within the \"Disciplinas\" page. My aim is to monitor each topic individually, recording hours studied, the total number of questions attempted, and crucially, the number of questions answered correctly. This level of granularity is essential for a thorough understanding of knowledge gaps.\n\n\n**Visualizing Performance Metrics**\n\nI'm now integrating a performance visualization. I'm leveraging the existing `Topic` interface (with `studyTimeMinutes`, `questionsAttempted`, `questionsCorrect`) to build a mini-dashboard for each topic within the `Disciplinas` component. This includes progress bars or badges reflecting the \"Hit Rate.\" The goal is a clear, concise visual cue for quick assessment.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
    },
    "createdTimestamp": {
      "seconds": 1769183637,
      "nanos": 114000000
    },
    "doneTimestamp": {
