interaction for topic display, too.\n\n\n**Integrating Topic Input**\n\nI am now integrating the topic input component with an `input` field and an \"add\" button. I am confirming proper event handling with `onChange` and `onClick`. I am verifying the \"Enter\" keypress triggers the `addTopic` function. Additionally, the `newTopicTitle` state is managed to get the value.\n\n\n**Implementing Topic Interaction**\n\nI'm now integrating the provided UI elements for topic display and interaction. My goal is to add toggle and last studied date display functionality within each topic item. I am focusing on the integration of the toggle functionality, as I need to include the date display. I am now proceeding with verifying the implementation.\n\n\n**Integrating Progress UI**\n\nI'm now integrating the progress UI. I've focused on displaying progress details. Also, I'm integrating the provided code, and the interactions with \"open progress form\", ensuring that `activeProgressTopic === topic.id` is correctly implemented. I am verifying the proper triggering of form opening.\n\n\n**Verifying Input Integration**\n\nI am now focusing on integrating the data input within the progress UI. Specifically, I'm integrating the `number` input for progress data within the topic progress form. The aim is to verify user input of numeric values and their consistent handling. I am also making sure the data input is fully integrated with the form state.\n\n\n**Validating Numeric Inputs**\n\nI'm now carefully examining the behavior and validations for number input within the progress form. I'm focusing on ensuring data integrity when the user is trying to add their time. I am now validating that the data from the input is consistent and correctly formatted.\n\n\n",
