ting Date Input**\n\nI'm now validating the date input functionality within the study registration form, focusing on how the `progDate` state variable is updated with the user-selected date via the `onChange` handler. I'll confirm proper state management and the intended date format.\n\nI'm also validating the `input` field's `onChange` event, and the proper handling of the user-selected date through the `progDate` state variable, confirming correct state updates, and ensuring that the selected date is correctly formatted.\n\n\n**Validating Time Input**\n\nI'm now focusing on the study time input fields, validating updates to `progHours` and `progMinutes` via their respective `onChange` handlers. I'm verifying the input parsing to ensure proper integer handling and that the state updates trigger effectively.\n\n\n**Validating Form Logic**\n\nI'm now validating the logic within the study registration form. I need to verify that all form inputs, including hours, minutes, and total questions, correctly update their corresponding state variables - ensuring all state updates are accurate. I will focus on confirming the correctness of these updates.\n\n\\n\\n\nI'm ensuring that input validation happens, that I'm able to convert the input to numbers, and that there are no errors in converting to numbers. I will now validate the total question input to make sure values like negative numbers aren't allowed.\n\n\n**Validating Correct Input**\n\nI'm now focusing on the `progCorrect` input. I need to validate the input to ensure that only numeric values can be entered. I'll focus on ensuring that negative numbers and other invalid inputs are handled correctly, and the display on the app remains consistent.\n\n\n",
