    "id": 429,
    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Developing Concurseiro Pro AI**\n\nI've been meticulously crafting Concurseiro Pro AI. The functional core is now fully integrated with Supabase. I'm focusing on professional aesthetics and high-end UI/UX, prioritizing a polished and user-friendly experience. Currently, I'm addressing some crucial technical issues, particularly with Recharts resizing and authentication state handling.\n\n\n**Refining Structure and UI**\n\nI'm applying DRY principles and optimizing for performance, also prioritizing offline resilience. I've integrated the Revisao and Disciplinas code models. The app is coming together nicely, with focus on the main entry point, Dashboard, and specific components. Now, I'm refactoring for data synchronization to handle Supabase calls with robust error handling and local state fallbacks. I'm also implementing a consistent typography (Inter) and a sophisticated color palette (Indigo, Slate, Emerald) for the UI.\n\n\n**Implementing New Logics**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in implementing the updated `Disciplinas` and `Revisao` logic, adapting them for Supabase and offline functionality. I'm focusing on ensuring data consistency across `subjects`, `mocks`, and `study_logs`, and have begun tracking study hours via a `study_logs` table sync. Simultaneously, I'm cleaning up code, removing unnecessary logs and optimizing imports, and adding better feedback for saving and loading states. I'm starting work on key updates as well.\n\n\n**Enhancing Critical Functions**\n\nI'm currently refining key functions. Specifically, I'm working on *Disciplinas* to incorporate \"Catalog\" and \"Bulk Import\" features, ensuring data integrity with Supabase, and calculating intervals from `lastStudiedAt` for *Revisao*. I'm also providing the `onAddLog` function for the components to properly update the database. Additionally, I've implemented a null check for `supabase` before making calls, and I'm utilizing `gemini-3-pro-preview` for complex reasoning within schedules. I've corrected Recharts behavior in the Dashboard and integrated the 7/15/30 logic in Revisao. I've also incorporated the Vertical Syllabus and Catalog into Disciplinas, and refined UI with Glassmorphism and Dark Mode.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
    },
