  {
    "id": 451,
    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Defining the Exam Platform**\n\nI'm currently focused on defining the core features of the exam platform. I'm exploring an AI-driven study cycle generator using Gemini, coupled with detailed topic control and study logging. Mock exam stats and review functionalities are also key considerations, aimed at providing a comprehensive study experience.\n\n\n**Refining the Integration**\n\nI'm now diving deep into Supabase integration, focusing on real-time synchronization and error handling. I'm also reviewing how the `profiles` table is utilized, especially during initial user loading. Functionality-wise, I'm making sure the non-cumulative logic is robust and ensuring that study logs dynamically update topic status, as they should. The UI/UX enhancements are underway, focusing on typography, micro-interactions, and a cohesive color palette.\n\n\n**Integrating Review Logic**\n\nI'm now integrating the review logic. I'm also refining the AI study cycle generation by focusing on the prompt and parsing reliability. I'm deep diving into the structural improvements, specifically centralizing data fetching, fixing the `TypeError: Failed to fetch` error more deeply, and implementing real-time sync hints. Design-wise, I'm working on the dynamic dashboard, animations using Framer Motion style transitions, and refining the typography. I also aim to improve the Modal experience for an Apple-like feel.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
    },
    "createdTimestamp": {
      "seconds": 1769195167,
      "nanos": 951000000
