    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "As part of our commitment to a **Premium Academic Experience**, a new \"Master Catalog Integration\" layer was implemented. This allows students to skip manual entry by importing pre-vetted exam structures directly into their personal study matrix.\n\n### Specification of Updates:\n\n1.  **Catalog Discovery Module**: A new interactive header section in the \"Edital Vertical\" page allows users to browse through editais prepared by administrators.\n2.  **Smart Importer Logic**: \n    *   **Deep Cloning**: When a catalog is selected, the system performs a deep clone of all subjects and topics, generating unique local IDs to prevent data collision.\n    *   **State Reconciliation**: If the user already has subjects, the system prompts for confirmation before merging or replacing, ensuring data safety.\n    *   **Cloud Sync**: Imported matrices are automatically synchronized with the Supabase backend (when online).\n3.  **Visual Refinement**: \n    *   Added an \"Import Badge\" with a pulsating `Sparkles` icon to highlight the feature.\n    *   Used a slide-down animation for the catalog selection menu.\n    *   Implemented high-contrast buttons with `indigo` and `rose` accents to distinguish between manual entry and catalog loading.\n\n",
