    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Com base no seu relato, identifiquei uma falha crítica na arquitetura de persistência: as operações de banco de dados (Supabase) não estavam associando os dados ao `user_id` do usuário logado, e o Catálogo Mestre (Editais) não possuía um tratamento de erro visível para o administrador caso o banco recusasse a gravação.\n\n### Especificação Técnica das Correções:\n\n1.  **Sincronização Vinculada ao Usuário (Multitenancy)**:\n    *   **App.tsx**: As consultas ao Supabase (`subjects`, `mocks`, `study_logs`) agora utilizam o filtro `.eq('user_id', userId)`. Isso garante que cada usuário veja apenas seus próprios dados.\n    *   **Disciplinas.tsx & Simulados.tsx**: Ao inserir novas disciplinas ou simulados, o sistema agora envia explicitamente o `user_id: user.id`.\n2.  **Persistência do Catálogo Mestre (Admin)**:\n    *   **Admin.tsx**: Reforcei a função `saveEdital` para garantir que o objeto enviado ao banco contenha todos os campos necessários. Adicionei um alerta de erro caso a gravação no Supabase falhe (ex: erro de permissão RLS ou tabela inexistente).\n3.  **Proteção contra Cache Volátil**:\n    *   Ajustei a lógica de carregamento no `App.tsx` para que o cache local (`sf_cache_`) atue como uma \"âncora\". Se o banco de dados retornar vazio por qualquer motivo (erro de rede ou limpeza de banco), o sistema não apagará os dados do usuário, preservando o que está no dispositivo.\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
    },
    "createdTimestamp": {
      "seconds": 1769197959,
      "nanos": 577000000
    },
    "doneTimestamp": {
      "seconds": 1769197959,
      "nanos": 780000000
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 486,
    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "generationTable",
      "entries": [
        {
          "path": "App.tsx",
          "generationType": 1,
          "isDone": true,
          "description": "Correção nas consultas de banco de dados para filtrar por user_id e melhoria na lógica de persistência para evitar perda de dados.",
          "diffs": [
            {
              "target": "",
              "replacement": "\nimport React, { useState, useEffect, useCallback, useRef, useMemo } from 'react';\nimport { \n  Home, BookOpen, RefreshCcw, Calendar, BarChart2, LogOut, Menu, X,\n  BrainCircuit, Award, Sun, Moon, Users, Database, Loader2, ShieldCheck, \n  Eye, Settings, WifiOff, CloudSync, User as UserIcon, Sparkles\n} from 'lucide-react';\nimport { User, Subject, MockExam, StudyCycle, StudySession, PredefinedEdital } from './types';\nimport { supabase, isNetworkError } from './lib/supabase';\nimport Login from './components/Login';\nimport Disciplinas from './components/Disciplinas';\nimport Ciclos from './components/Ciclos';\nimport Revisao from './components/Revisao';\nimport Simulados from './components/Simulados';\nimport Dashboard from './components/Dashboard';\nimport Admin from './components/Admin';\nimport Profile from './components/Profile';\n\nconst App: React.FC = () => {\n  const [user, setUser] = useState<User | null>(null);\n  const [currentPage, setCurrentPage] = useState('inicio');\n  const [subjects, setSubjects] = useState<Subject[]>([]);\n  const [mocks, setMocks] = useState<MockExam[]>([]);\n  const [cycle, setCycle] = useState<StudyCycle | null>(null);\n  const [studyLogs, setStudyLogs] = useState<StudySession[]>([]);\n  const [allUsers, setAllUsers] = useState<User[]>([]);\n  const [isLoaded, setIsLoaded] = useState(false);\n  const [isSidebarOpen, setIsSidebarOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [isLoggingOut, setIsLoggingOut] = useState(false);\n  const [isOffline, setIsOffline] = useState(false);\n  const [isSyncing, setIsSyncing] = useState(false);\n  const [isProfileOpen, setIsProfileOpen] = useState(false);\n  const loggingOutRef = useRef(false);\n  \n  const [isDarkMode, setIsDarkMode] = useState(() => {\n    const saved = localStorage.getItem('theme');\n    return saved ? saved === 'dark' : window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;\n  });\n\n  const saveToLocal = useCallback((key: string, data: any) => {\n    localStorage.setItem(`sf_cache_${key}`, JSON.stringify(data));\n  }, []);\n\n  const loadFromLocal = useCallback((key: string) => {\n    const data = localStorage.getItem(`sf_cache_${key}`);\n    return data ? JSON.parse(data) : null;\n  }, []);\n\n  const [editais, setEditais] = useState<PredefinedEdital[]>(() => {\n    const cached = localStorage.getItem('sf_cache_editais');\n    if (cached) return JSON.parse(cached);\n    return [];\n  });\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (editais.length > 0) saveToLocal('editais', editais);\n  }, [editais, saveToLocal]);\n\n  const fetchUserData = useCallback(async (userId: string) => {\n    // Carrega cache local imediatamente\n    const cachedSubjects = loadFromLocal('subjects');\n    const cachedMocks = loadFromLocal('mocks');\n    const cachedLogs = loadFromLocal('logs');\n\n    if (cachedSubjects) setSubjects(cachedSubjects);\n    if (cachedMocks) setMocks(cachedMocks);\n    if (cachedLogs) setStudyLogs(cachedLogs);\n\n    if (!supabase || loggingOutRef.current) return;\n\n    setIsSyncing(true);\n    try {\n      // Consultas filtradas por user_id para garantir multitenancy\n      const [subRes, mockRes, logRes, editalRes] = await Promise.all([\n        supabase.from('subjects').select('*').eq('user_id', userId).order('created_at', { ascending: true }),\n        supabase.from('mocks').select('*').eq('user_id', userId).order('date', { ascending: false }),\n        supabase.from('study_logs').select('*').eq('user_id', userId).order('date', { ascending: false }),\n        supabase.from('predefined_editais').select('*')\n      ]);\n\n      if (subRes.data && subRes.data.length > 0) {\n        const mapped = subRes.data.map((s, i) => ({\n          ...s, id: String(s.id), topics: s.topics || [],\n          color: s.color || ['#6366f1', '#10b981', '#f59e0b', '#ec4899', '#8b5cf6'][i % 5]\n        }));\n        setSubjects(mapped);\n        saveToLocal('subjects', mapped);\n      }\n\n      if (mockRes.data && mockRes.data.length > 0) {\n        const mapped = mockRes.data.map(m => ({ ...m, id: String(m.id) }));\n        setMocks(mapped);\n        saveToLocal('mocks', mapped);\n      }\n\n      if (logRes.data && logRes.data.length > 0) {\n        const mapped = logRes.data.map(l => ({ ...l, id: String(l.id) }));\n        setStudyLogs(mapped);\n        saveToLocal('logs', mapped);\n      }\n\n      if (editalRes.data && editalRes.data.length > 0) {\n        setEditais(editalRes.data);\n        saveToLocal('editais', editalRes.data);\n      }\n\n      setIsOffline(false);\n    } catch (e: any) {\n      if (isNetworkError(e)) setIsOffline(true);\n    } finally {\n      setIsSyncing(false);\n    }\n  }, [loadFromLocal, saveToLocal]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const root = window.document.documentElement;\n    if (isDarkMode) root.classList.add('dark');\n    else root.classList.remove('dark');\n    localStorage.setItem('theme', isDarkMode ? 'dark' : 'light');\n  }, [isDarkMode]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    let isMounted = true;\n    const init = async () => {\n      if (!supabase) { setIsLoaded(true); return; }\n      try {\n        const { data: { session } } = await supabase.auth.getSession();\n        if (isMounted && session?.user) {\n          const { data: profile } = await supabase.from('profiles').select('*').eq('id', session.user.id).single();\n          \n          const newUser: User = {\n            id: session.user.id,\n            name: profile?.full_name || session.user.user_metadata?.full_name || 'Usuário',\n            email: session.user.email!,\n            role: profile?.role || (session.user.email === 'ralysonriccelli@gmail.com' ? 'administrator' : 'student'),\n            status: profile?.status || 'active',\n            isOnline: true,\n            weeklyGoal: profile?.weekly_goal || 20\n          };\n          \n          if (newUser.status === 'blocked') {\n            await supabase.auth.signOut();\n            return;\n          }\n\n          setUser(newUser);\n          fetchUserData(session.user.id);\n          \n          if (newUser.role === 'administrator') {\n            const { data: profiles } = await supabase.from('profiles').select('*');\n            if (profiles) setAllUsers(profiles);\n          }\n        }\n      } catch (e) {\n        console.warn(\"Offline initialization active.\");\n      } finally { if (isMounted) setIsLoaded(true); }\n    };\n    init();\n    return () => { isMounted = false; };\n  }, [fetchUserData]);\n\n  const addStudyLog = useCallback(async (minutes: number, topicId: string, subjectId: string, date: string) => {\n    if (!user) return;\n    const newEntry: StudySession = { \n      id: `local-${Date.now()}`, \n      minutes, \n      topicId, \n      subjectId, \n      date: date,\n      type: 'estudo' \n    };\n\n    setStudyLogs(prev => {\n      const up = [newEntry, ...prev];\n      saveToLocal('logs', up);\n      return up;\n    });\n\n    if (user.role === 'visitor' || !supabase) return;\n\n    try {\n      await supabase.from('study_logs').insert([{\n        user_id: user.id,\n        minutes, \n        topic_id: topicId, \n        subject_id: subjectId, \n        date: date, \n        type: 'estudo'\n      }]);\n    } catch (e) {\n      if (isNetworkError(e)) setIsOffline(true);\n    }\n  }, [user, saveToLocal]);\n\n  const handleLogout = async () => {\n    loggingOutRef.current = true;\n    setIsLoggingOut(true);\n    if (supabase) await supabase.auth.signOut();\n    localStorage.clear();\n    setUser(null);\n    setSubjects([]);\n    setMocks([]);\n    setStudyLogs([]);\n    setIsLoggingOut(false);\n    loggingOutRef.current = false;\n  };\n\n  if (!isLoaded || isLoggingOut) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n        <Loader2 className=\"animate-spin text-indigo-600 mb-4\" size={48} />\n        <p className=\"text-slate-500 font-black uppercase text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em]\">Sincronizando Fluxo</p>\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n  if (!user) return <Login users={allUsers} onLogin={(u) => { setUser(u); fetchUserData(u.id); }} onRegister={(u) => { setUser(u); fetchUserData(u.id); }} />;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex h-screen bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 overflow-hidden\">\n      <div className=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-[100] pointer-events-none\">\n        {isOffline && (\n          <div className=\"bg-rose-600 text-white text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] py-1 text-center pointer-events-auto\">\n            MODO OFFLINE: DADOS SALVOS LOCALMENTE\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </div>\n\n      <button className=\"md:hidden fixed top-6 left-6 z-[60] p-4 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl\" onClick={() => setIsSidebarOpen(!isSidebarOpen)}>\n        {isSidebarOpen ? <X size={24} /> : <Menu size={24} />}\n      </button>\n\n      <aside className={`fixed inset-y-0 left-0 z-50 w-80 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 transform transition-transform duration-500 md:translate-x-0 ${isSidebarOpen ? 'translate-x-0' : '-translate-x-full'}`}>\n        <div className=\"flex flex-col h-full\">\n          <div className=\"p-10 pt-16\">\n            <h1 className=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tighter\">StudyFlow</h1>\n            <p className=\"text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-indigo-500\">Lógica de Aprovação</p>\n          </div>\n          \n          <nav className=\"flex-1 px-6 space-y-2 overflow-y-auto\">\n            {[\n              { id: 'inicio', label: 'Dashboard', icon: <Home size={20} />, roles: ['administrator', 'student', 'visitor'] },\n              { id: 'disciplinas', label: 'Edital Vertical', icon: <BookOpen size={20} />, roles: ['administrator', 'student', 'visitor'] },\n              { id: 'ciclos', label: 'Mentoria IA', icon: <BrainCircuit size={20} />, roles: ['administrator', 'student', 'visitor'] },\n              { id: 'revisao', label: 'Revisões', icon: <RefreshCcw size={20} />, roles: ['administrator', 'student', 'visitor'] },\n              { id: 'simulados', label: 'Simulados', icon: <BarChart2 size={20} />, roles: ['administrator', 'student', 'visitor'] },\n              { id: 'admin_users', label: 'Comunidade', icon: <Users size={20} />, roles: ['administrator'] },\n              { id: 'admin_editais', label: 'Master Editais', icon: <Settings size={20} />, roles: ['administrator'] },\n            ].filter(i => i.roles.includes(user.role)).map((item) => (\n              <button \n                key={item.id} \n                onClick={() => { setCurrentPage(item.id); setIsSidebarOpen(false); }} \n                className={`w-full flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider transition-all ${currentPage === item.id ? 'bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-xl translate-x-1' : 'text-slate-500 hover:bg-white dark:hover:bg-slate-800'}`}\n              >\n                {item.icon} {item.label}\n              </button>\n            ))}\n          </nav>\n\n          <div className=\"p-8 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n             <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-6\">\n                <button onClick={() => setIsDarkMode(!isDarkMode)} className=\"flex-1 p-3 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 flex justify-center\">\n                  {isDarkMode ? <Sun size={18} /> : <Moon size={18} />}\n                </button>\n                <button onClick={() => setIsProfileOpen(true)} className=\"flex-1 p-3 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 flex justify-center\">\n                  <UserIcon size={18} />\n                </button>\n             </div>\n             <button onClick={handleLogout} className=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-rose-500 font-black text-[10px] uppercase p-4 hover:bg-rose-50 rounded-xl transition-all\">\n               <LogOut size={16} /> Encerrar\n             </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n\n      <main className=\"flex-1 md:ml-80 overflow-y-auto bg-white dark:bg-slate-950\">\n        <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto p-8 md:p-16\">\n          {currentPage === 'inicio' && <Dashboard subjects={subjects} mocks={mocks} cycle={cycle} studyLogs={studyLogs} weeklyGoal={user.weeklyGoal || 20} onUpdateGoal={() => {}} isDarkMode={isDarkMode} />}\n          {currentPage === 'disciplinas' && <Disciplinas user={user} subjects={subjects} setSubjects={setSubjects} predefinedEditais={editais} onAddLog={addStudyLog} />}\n          {currentPage === 'ciclos' && <Ciclos subjects={subjects} setCycle={setCycle} cycle={cycle} />}\n          {currentPage === 'revisao' && <Revisao subjects={subjects} setSubjects={setSubjects} onAddLog={addStudyLog} />}\n          {currentPage === 'simulados' && <Simulados user={user} mocks={mocks} setMocks={setMocks} subjects={subjects} />}\n          {currentPage === 'admin_users' && <Admin user={user} users={allUsers} setUsers={setAllUsers} editais={editais} setEditais={setEditais} view=\"users\" />}\n          {currentPage === 'admin_editais' && <Admin user={user} users={allUsers} setUsers={setAllUsers} editais={editais} setEditais={setEditais} view=\"editais\" />}\n        </div>\n      </main>\n\n      {isProfileOpen && (\n        <Profile user={user} onUpdate={(u) => { setUser(u); saveToLocal('user', u); }} onDelete={handleLogout} onClose={() => setIsProfileOpen(false)} onExport={() => {}} onImport={() => {}} />\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default App;\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "path": "components/Disciplinas.tsx",
          "generationType": 1,
          "isDone": true,
          "description": "Inclusão do user_id nas operações de banco de dados para garantir que os dados importados do catálogo sejam salvos corretamente no perfil do usuário.",
          "diffs": [
            {
              "target": "",
              "replacement": "\nimport React, { useState, useCallback } from 'react';\nimport { Subject, Topic, PredefinedEdital, User } from '../types';\nimport { supabase, isNetworkError } from '../lib/supabase';\nimport { \n  Plus, Trash2, ChevronDown, ChevronUp, CheckCircle, TrendingUp, Save, Check, Clock, Calendar, Sparkles, X, DownloadCloud, AlertCircle\n} from 'lucide-react';\n\ninterface DisciplinasProps {\n  user: User;\n  subjects: Subject[];\n  setSubjects: React.Dispatch<React.SetStateAction<Subject[]>>;\n  predefinedEditais: PredefinedEdital[];\n  onAddLog: (minutes: number, topicId: string, subjectId: string, date: string) => void;\n}\n\nconst Disciplinas: React.FC<DisciplinasProps> = ({ user, subjects, setSubjects, predefinedEditais, onAddLog }) => {\n  const [newSubjectName, setNewSubjectName] = useState('');\n  const [expandedSubject, setExpandedSubject] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [newTopicTitle, setNewTopicTitle] = useState('');\n  const [activeProgressTopic, setActiveProgressTopic] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [isSyncing, setIsSyncing] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [showCatalog, setShowCatalog] = useState(false);\n\n  // Modal Progress State\n  const [progDate, setProgDate] = useState<string>(new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]);\n  const [progHours, setProgHours] = useState<number>(0);\n  const [progMinutes, setProgMinutes] = useState<number>(0);\n  const [progAttempted, setProgAttempted] = useState<number>(0);\n  const [progCorrect, setProgCorrect] = useState<number>(0);\n\n  const colors = ['#6366f1', '#10b981', '#f59e0b', '#ec4899', '#8b5cf6', '#3b82f6'];\n\n  const handleSubjectUpdate = useCallback(async (subjectId: string, updatedTopics: Topic[]) => {\n    const sId = String(subjectId);\n    setSubjects(prev => {\n      const next = prev.map(s => String(s.id) === sId ? { ...s, topics: updatedTopics } : s);\n      localStorage.setItem('sf_cache_subjects', JSON.stringify(next));\n      return next;\n    });\n\n    if (supabase && !sId.startsWith('local-') && !sId.startsWith('imported-')) {\n      setIsSyncing(sId);\n      try { \n        await supabase.from('subjects').update({ topics: updatedTopics }).eq('id', sId).eq('user_id', user.id);\n      } catch (err: any) { \n        if (!isNetworkError(err)) console.error(\"Database Sync Failed:\", err);\n      } finally { setIsSyncing(null); }\n    }\n  }, [setSubjects, user]);\n\n  const addSubject = async () => {\n    if (!newSubjectName.trim()) return;\n    const tempId = `local-${Date.now()}`;\n    const newSub: Subject = { id: tempId, name: newSubjectName.trim(), topics: [], color: colors[subjects.length % colors.length] };\n    \n    setSubjects(prev => [...prev, newSub]);\n    setNewSubjectName('');\n\n    if (supabase && user.role !== 'visitor') {\n      try {\n        const { data } = await supabase.from('subjects').insert([{ \n          name: newSub.name, \n          topics: [], \n          user_id: user.id,\n          color: newSub.color\n        }]).select().single();\n        if (data) setSubjects(prev => prev.map(s => s.id === tempId ? { ...s, id: String(data.id) } : s));\n      } catch (e) {}\n    }\n  };\n\n  const deleteSubject = async (e: React.MouseEvent, subjectId: string) => {\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    if (!window.confirm(\"Excluir esta disciplina permanentemente?\")) return;\n\n    const sId = String(subjectId);\n    setSubjects(prev => {\n      const next = prev.filter(s => String(s.id) !== sId);\n      localStorage.setItem('sf_cache_subjects', JSON.stringify(next));\n      return next;\n    });\n\n    if (supabase && !sId.startsWith('local-') && !sId.startsWith('imported-')) {\n      try {\n        await supabase.from('subjects').delete().eq('id', sId).eq('user_id', user.id);\n      } catch (err) {\n        console.error(\"Erro ao excluir disciplina:\", err);\n      }\n    }\n  };\n\n  const importFromCatalog = async (edital: PredefinedEdital) => {\n    if (subjects.length > 0) {\n      if (!window.confirm(`Adicionar as disciplinas de \"${edital.name}\" ao seu edital atual?`)) return;\n    }\n\n    const clonedSubjects: Subject[] = edital.subjects.map((sub, idx) => ({\n      ...sub,\n      id: `imported-${Date.now()}-${idx}`,\n      topics: sub.topics.map(topic => ({\n        ...topic,\n        id: `topic-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`,\n        completed: false,\n        studyTimeMinutes: 0,\n        questionsAttempted: 0,\n        questionsCorrect: 0\n      }))\n    }));\n\n    setSubjects(prev => {\n      const updated = [...prev, ...clonedSubjects];\n      localStorage.setItem('sf_cache_subjects', JSON.stringify(updated));\n      return updated;\n    });\n    setShowCatalog(false);\n\n    if (supabase && user.role !== 'visitor') {\n      for (const sub of clonedSubjects) {\n        try {\n          await supabase.from('subjects').insert([{ \n            name: sub.name, \n            topics: sub.topics, \n            color: sub.color,\n            user_id: user.id \n          }]);\n        } catch (e) {\n          console.error(\"Erro ao sincronizar importação:\", e);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  };\n\n  const toggleTopic = async (subId: string, topicId: string) => {\n    const sub = subjects.find(s => String(s.id) === String(subId));\n    if (!sub) return;\n    const next = sub.topics.map(t => String(t.id) === String(topicId) ? { ...t, completed: !t.completed } : t);\n    await handleSubjectUpdate(subId, next);\n  };\n\n  const saveTopicProgress = async (subId: string, topicId: string) => {\n    const sub = subjects.find(s => String(s.id) === String(subId));\n    if (!sub) return;\n    const totalMins = (progHours * 60) + (progMinutes || 0);\n    const targetDate = new Date(`${progDate}T12:00:00`).toISOString();\n\n    const next = sub.topics.map(t => String(t.id) === String(topicId) ? {\n      ...t, \n      studyTimeMinutes: (t.studyTimeMinutes || 0) + totalMins,\n      questionsAttempted: (t.questionsAttempted || 0) + progAttempted,\n      questionsCorrect: (t.questionsCorrect || 0) + progCorrect,\n      lastStudiedAt: targetDate\n    } : t);\n\n    if (totalMins > 0 || progAttempted > 0) {\n      onAddLog(totalMins, topicId, subId, targetDate);\n    }\n    \n    await handleSubjectUpdate(subId, next);\n    setActiveProgressTopic(null);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"space-y-10 animate-in fade-in duration-700 pb-24\">\n      <header className=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 className=\"text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 tracking-tighter\">Edital Vertical</h2>\n          <p className=\"text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-bold mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">Sincronização Profissional de Tópicos</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"flex gap-3\">\n          <button \n            onClick={() => setShowCatalog(!showCatalog)}\n            className={`flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all shadow-xl active:scale-95 ${showCatalog ? 'bg-rose-500 text-white' : 'bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-indigo-600 border border-indigo-100 dark:border-slate-800'}`}\n          >\n            {showCatalog ? <X size={18} /> : <DownloadCloud size={18} />}\n            {showCatalog ? 'Fechar Catálogo' : 'Carregar Catálogo'}\n          </button>\n          <div className=\"hidden md:flex gap-3\">\n            <input \n              type=\"text\" \n              placeholder=\"Nova Disciplina...\" \n              className=\"px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 font-bold text-sm outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 w-full md:w-64\"\n              value={newSubjectName} \n              onChange={(e) => setNewSubjectName(e.target.value)} \n              onKeyPress={(e) => e.key === 'Enter' && addSubject()} \n            />\n            <button onClick={addSubject} className=\"bg-indigo-600 text-white p-4 rounded-2xl hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all shadow-xl active:scale-95\">\n              <Plus size={24} />\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      {showCatalog && (\n        <div className=\"bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/20 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-indigo-100 dark:border-indigo-900/30 animate-in slide-in-from-top-6 duration-500\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n            <h3 className=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-tighter\">Editais Disponíveis</h3>\n            <p className=\"text-[10px] font-black text-indigo-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">Modelos do Catálogo Mestre</p>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n            {predefinedEditais.map(edital => (\n              <div key={edital.id} className=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all group relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div className=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-indigo-600\" />\n                <h4 className=\"font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2\">{edital.name}</h4>\n                <p className=\"text-[9px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-6\">{edital.organization}</p>\n                <button \n                  onClick={() => importFromCatalog(edital)}\n                  className=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white py-3 rounded-xl text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all shadow-lg\"\n                >\n                  <Plus size={14} /> Importar Matriz\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            ))}\n            {predefinedEditais.length === 0 && (\n              <div className=\"col-span-full py-10 text-center text-slate-400 font-bold italic\">\n                Nenhum edital cadastrado no catálogo mestre ainda.\n              </div>\n            )}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6\">\n        {subjects.map(sub => {\n          const total = sub.topics.length;\n          const done = sub.topics.filter(t => t.completed).length;\n          const isExp = expandedSubject === String(sub.id);\n\n          return (\n            <div key={sub.id} className={`bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ${isExp ? 'ring-2 ring-indigo-500/20 shadow-2xl' : 'hover:shadow-lg'}`}>\n              <div className=\"p-8 flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer\" onClick={() => setExpandedSubject(isExp ? null : String(sub.id))}>\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n                  <div className=\"w-4 h-12 rounded-full\" style={{ backgroundColor: sub.color }} />\n                  <div>\n                    <h3 className=\"font-black text-xl text-slate-800 dark:text-white tracking-tight\">{sub.name}</h3>\n                    <p className=\"text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1.5\">{done} de {total} tópicos concluídos</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                  <button onClick={(e) => deleteSubject(e, String(sub.id))} className=\"p-3 text-slate-300 hover:text-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-50 rounded-2xl transition-all\"><Trash2 size={20} /></button>\n                  <div className={`p-3 rounded-2xl transition-all ${isExp ? 'bg-indigo-600 text-white' : 'bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-400'}`}>\n                    {isExp ? <ChevronUp size={22} /> : <ChevronDown size={22} />}\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {isExp && (\n                <div className=\"px-10 pb-10 pt-4 border-t border-slate-50 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-4 animate-in slide-in-from-top-4\">\n                  <div className=\"flex gap-3 mb-6\">\n                    <input \n                      type=\"text\" \n                      placeholder=\"Adicionar tópico...\" \n                      className=\"flex-1 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-transparent focus:border-indigo-500 outline-none font-bold text-sm dark:text-white transition-all\"\n                      value={newTopicTitle} \n                      onChange={(e) => setNewTopicTitle(e.target.value)} \n                      onKeyPress={(e) => e.key === 'Enter' && (async () => {\n                        const nt: Topic = { id: `topic-${Date.now()}`, title: newTopicTitle.trim(), completed: false, importance: 3, studyTimeMinutes: 0 };\n                        await handleSubjectUpdate(String(sub.id), [...sub.topics, nt]);\n                        setNewTopicTitle('');\n                      })()} \n                    />\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3\">\n                    {sub.topics.map(topic => (\n                      <div key={topic.id} className=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-5 p-5 bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-slate-800/40 rounded-[1.5rem] group hover:bg-white transition-all border border-transparent hover:border-slate-100\">\n                        <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 flex-1\">\n                          <button onClick={() => toggleTopic(String(sub.id), topic.id)} className={`mt-1 transition-all ${topic.completed ? 'text-indigo-600' : 'text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-400'}`}>\n                            <CheckCircle size={24} strokeWidth={topic.completed ? 3 : 2} />\n                          </button>\n                          <div className=\"flex-1\">\n                            <span className={`text-sm font-black block leading-tight ${topic.completed ? 'text-slate-400 line-through' : 'text-slate-700 dark:text-white'}`}>{topic.title}</span>\n                            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-3\">\n                                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[9px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm\"><Clock size={10} className=\"text-indigo-500\" /> {topic.studyTimeMinutes || 0}m</div>\n                                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[9px] font-black text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-widest bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-transparent\"><Calendar size={10} /> {topic.lastStudiedAt ? new Date(topic.lastStudiedAt).toLocaleDateString() : 'NUNCA'}</div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">\n                          <button onClick={() => { setActiveProgressTopic(topic.id); setProgHours(0); setProgMinutes(0); setProgAttempted(0); setProgCorrect(0); }} className=\"px-5 py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-xl text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest shadow-xl flex items-center gap-2 transition-all\"><TrendingUp size={14} /> Registrar</button>\n                          <button onClick={async () => { const nt = sub.topics.filter(t => t.id !== topic.id); await handleSubjectUpdate(String(sub.id), nt); }} className=\"p-2.5 text-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-50 rounded-xl transition-all\"><Trash2 size={16} /></button>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    ))}\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              )}\n            </div>\n          );\n        })}\n      </div>\n\n      {activeProgressTopic && (\n        <div className=\"fixed inset-0 z-[120] flex items-center justify-center p-6 bg-slate-900/70 backdrop-blur-md animate-in fade-in\">\n          <div className=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 w-full max-w-md rounded-[3rem] p-10 shadow-2xl relative\">\n             <button onClick={() => setActiveProgressTopic(null)} className=\"absolute top-8 right-8 p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 transition-colors\"><X size={20} /></button>\n            <h3 className=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2\">Consolidar Estudo</h3>\n            <p className=\"text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-8\">Registrar sessão de estudo</p>\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div className=\"space-y-2\">\n                <label className=\"text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest block\">Data</label>\n                <input type=\"date\" className=\"w-full px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 font-black text-sm outline-none transition-all\" value={progDate} onChange={(e) => setProgDate(e.target.value)} />\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div className=\"space-y-2\">\n                  <label className=\"text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">Horas</label>\n                  <input type=\"number\" className=\"w-full px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl border bg-slate-50 font-black text-lg outline-none\" value={progHours || ''} onChange={e => setProgHours(parseInt(e.target.value) || 0)} placeholder=\"0\" />\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"space-y-2\">\n                  <label className=\"text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">Minutos</label>\n                  <input type=\"number\" className=\"w-full px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl border bg-slate-50 font-black text-lg outline-none\" value={progMinutes || ''} onChange={e => setProgMinutes(parseInt(e.target.value) || 0)} placeholder=\"0\" />\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <button onClick={() => { const sId = subjects.find(s => s.topics.some(t => t.id === activeProgressTopic))?.id; if(sId) saveTopicProgress(sId, activeProgressTopic); }} className=\"w-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-black py-5 rounded-[1.5rem] mt-10 shadow-2xl active:scale-95 transition-all uppercase text-[11px] tracking-widest\">Salvar Registro</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Disciplinas;\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "path": "components/Admin.tsx",
          "generationType": 1,
          "isDone": true,
          "description": "Inclusão de tratamento de erros e feedbacks visuais no salvamento do catálogo de editais.",
          "diffs": [
            {
              "target": "",
              "replacement": "\nimport React, { useState, useMemo } from 'react';\nimport { User, PredefinedEdital, Subject } from '../types';\nimport { supabase } from '../lib/supabase';\nimport { \n  Plus, Trash2, Edit3, X, Save, AlignLeft, BookOpen, Loader2, TrendingUp, Search, Mail, Database, Lock, Unlock, Check\n} from 'lucide-react';\n\ninterface AdminProps {\n  user: User;\n  users: User[];\n  setUsers: React.Dispatch<React.SetStateAction<User[]>>;\n  editais: PredefinedEdital[];\n  setEditais: React.Dispatch<React.SetStateAction<PredefinedEdital[]>>;\n  view: 'users' | 'editais';\n}\n\nconst Admin: React.FC<AdminProps> = ({ user, users, setUsers, editais, setEditais, view }) => {\n  const [isCreatingEdital, setIsCreatingEdital] = useState(false);\n  const [editingEdital, setEditingEdital] = useState<PredefinedEdital | null>(null);\n  const [newEditalName, setNewEditalName] = useState('');\n  const [newEditalOrg, setNewEditalOrg] = useState('');\n  const [newEditalExamDate, setNewEditalExamDate] = useState('');\n  const [editalSubjects, setEditalSubjects] = useState<Subject[]>([]);\n  const [isSaving, setIsSaving] = useState(false);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [searchTerm, setSearchTerm] = useState('');\n  \n  const colors = ['#6366f1', '#10b981', '#f59e0b', '#ec4899', '#8b5cf6', '#3b82f6'];\n\n  const filteredUsers = useMemo(() => {\n    return users.filter(u => \n      u.name.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm.toLowerCase()) || \n      u.email.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm.toLowerCase())\n    );\n  }, [users, searchTerm]);\n\n  const updateUserInDb = async (userId: string, updates: Partial<any>) => {\n    if (!supabase) return;\n    setLoading(userId);\n    try {\n      const { error } = await supabase.from('profiles').update(updates).eq('id', userId);\n      if (error) throw error;\n      setUsers(prev => prev.map(u => u.id === userId ? { ...u, ...updates } : u));\n    } catch (err: any) {\n      alert(\"Erro ao gerenciar usuário: \" + err.message);\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(null);\n    }\n  };\n\n  const saveEdital = async () => {\n    if (!newEditalName.trim() || !newEditalOrg.trim()) {\n      alert(\"Preencha o nome e a banca organizadora.\");\n      return;\n    }\n    \n    setIsSaving(true);\n    const edital: PredefinedEdital = { \n      id: editingEdital?.id || `catalog-${Date.now()}`, \n      name: newEditalName.trim(), \n      organization: newEditalOrg.trim(), \n      examDate: newEditalExamDate, \n      subjects: editalSubjects, \n      lastUpdated: new Date().toISOString() \n    };\n\n    try {\n      if (supabase) {\n        const { error } = await supabase.from('predefined_editais').upsert([{\n          id: edital.id,\n          name: edital.name,\n          organization: edital.organization,\n          exam_date: edital.examDate,\n          subjects: edital.subjects,\n          last_updated: edital.lastUpdated,\n          user_id: user.id\n        }]);\n        \n        if (error) throw error;\n      }\n\n      if (editingEdital) setEditais(prev => prev.map(e => String(e.id) === String(editingEdital.id) ? edital : e));\n      else setEditais(prev => [...prev, edital]);\n\n      setIsCreatingEdital(false);\n      alert(\"Edital salvo com sucesso no Catálogo Mestre!\");\n    } catch (err: any) {\n      console.error(\"Erro ao persistir catálogo:\", err);\n      alert(\"ERRO CRÍTICO: Não foi possível salvar no banco de dados. \" + err.message);\n    } finally {\n      setIsSaving(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  if (view === 'users') {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"space-y-10 animate-in fade-in duration-700\">\n        <header className=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 className=\"text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 tracking-tight\">Comunidade</h2>\n            <p className=\"text-slate-500 font-medium\">Gestão de alunos e permissões.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"relative\">\n            <Search className=\"absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400\" size={18} />\n            <input \n              type=\"text\" \n              placeholder=\"Pesquisar...\" \n              className=\"pl-12 pr-6 py-3.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 w-full md:w-80 font-bold shadow-sm\"\n              value={searchTerm}\n              onChange={(e) => setSearchTerm(e.target.value)}\n            />\n          </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <div className=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl overflow-x-auto\">\n          <table className=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n            <thead className=\"bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n              <tr>\n                <th className=\"px-8 py-6 text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-400\">Aluno</th>\n                <th className=\"px-8 py-6 text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-400\">Role</th>\n                <th className=\"px-8 py-6 text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-400 text-center\">Status</th>\n                <th className=\"px-8 py-6 text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-400 text-right\">Ação</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody className=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800\">\n              {filteredUsers.map(u => (\n                <tr key={u.id} className=\"hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors\">\n                  <td className=\"px-8 py-6\">\n                    <div className=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                      <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-black\">{u.name.charAt(0)}</div>\n                      <div className=\"text-sm font-black dark:text-white\">{u.name} <p className=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\">{u.email}</p></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                  <td className=\"px-8 py-6 text-xs font-black uppercase text-slate-500\">{u.role}</td>\n                  <td className=\"px-8 py-6 text-center\">\n                    <span className={`px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[9px] font-black uppercase ${u.status === 'active' ? 'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600' : 'bg-rose-50 text-rose-600'}`}>\n                      {u.status === 'active' ? 'Ativo' : 'Bloqueado'}\n                    </span>\n                  </td>\n                  <td className=\"px-8 py-6 text-right\">\n                    <button onClick={() => updateUserInDb(u.id, { status: u.status === 'active' ? 'blocked' : 'active' })} className=\"p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-indigo-600\">\n                      {loading === u.id ? <Loader2 className=\"animate-spin\" size={18} /> : (u.status === 'active' ? <Lock size={18} /> : <Unlock size={18} />)}\n                    </button>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              ))}\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"space-y-10 animate-in fade-in duration-500\">\n      <header className=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 className=\"text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight\">Catálogo de Editais</h2>\n          <p className=\"text-slate-500\">Gestão global de matrizes curriculares.</p>\n        </div>\n        <button onClick={() => { setIsCreatingEdital(true); setEditingEdital(null); setNewEditalName(''); setNewEditalOrg(''); setEditalSubjects([]); }} className=\"bg-rose-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl font-black shadow-xl hover:bg-rose-700 flex items-center gap-2 transition-all active:scale-95\"><Plus size={20} /> Novo Edital</button>\n      </header>\n\n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n        {editais.map(edital => (\n          <div key={edital.id} className=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm relative group hover:shadow-2xl transition-all\">\n            <div className=\"absolute top-8 right-8 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity flex gap-2\">\n              <button onClick={() => { setEditingEdital(edital); setNewEditalName(edital.name); setNewEditalOrg(edital.organization); setEditalSubjects(edital.subjects); setIsCreatingEdital(true); }} className=\"p-3 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-500 rounded-xl\"><Edit3 size={18} /></button>\n              <button onClick={async () => { if(window.confirm(\"Excluir do catálogo?\")) { setEditais(prev => prev.filter(e => e.id !== edital.id)); if (supabase) await supabase.from('predefined_editais').delete().eq('id', edital.id); } }} className=\"p-3 bg-rose-50 text-rose-500 rounded-xl\"><Trash2 size={18} /></button>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"w-16 h-16 bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-900/20 text-rose-600 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8\"><Database size={32} /></div>\n            <h3 className=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-tight\">{edital.name}</h3>\n            <span className=\"text-[10px] font-black bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest mt-4 inline-block\">{edital.organization}</span>\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n\n      {isCreatingEdital && (\n        <div className=\"fixed inset-0 z-[100] flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-md animate-in fade-in\">\n          <div className=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 w-full max-w-5xl rounded-[3rem] shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 h-[80vh] flex flex-col\">\n             <div className=\"flex flex-1 overflow-hidden\">\n               <div className=\"w-1/3 p-12 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border-r border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-8 overflow-y-auto\">\n                 <h3 className=\"text-3xl font-black dark:text-white\">Editor de Matriz</h3>\n                 <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n                   <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Nome do Certame\" className=\"w-full px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl border outline-none font-bold\" value={newEditalName} onChange={(e) => setNewEditalName(e.target.value)} />\n                   <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Banca\" className=\"w-full px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl border outline-none font-bold\" value={newEditalOrg} onChange={(e) => setNewEditalOrg(e.target.value)} />\n                 </div>\n                 <div className=\"pt-8 space-y-4\">\n                   <button onClick={saveEdital} disabled={isSaving} className=\"w-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-black py-5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                     {isSaving ? <Loader2 className=\"animate-spin\" size={20} /> : <Save size={20} />}\n                     {isSaving ? 'SALVANDO...' : 'SALVAR NO BANCO'}\n                   </button>\n                   <button onClick={() => setIsCreatingEdital(false)} className=\"w-full text-slate-500 font-black py-5\">DESCARTAR</button>\n                 </div>\n               </div>\n               <div className=\"flex-1 p-12 overflow-y-auto\">\n                  <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-10 pb-6 border-b\">\n                    <h4 className=\"font-black text-2xl dark:text-white flex items-center gap-3\"><BookOpen /> Grade Curricular</h4>\n                    <button onClick={() => setEditalSubjects(prev => [...prev, { id: `edsub-${Date.now()}`, name: 'Nova Disciplina', topics: [], color: colors[prev.length % colors.length] }])} className=\"text-[10px] font-black bg-slate-900 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl\">+ DISCIPLINA</button>\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"space-y-8\">\n                    {editalSubjects.map((sub, sIdx) => (\n                      <div key={sub.id} className=\"p-8 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-[2rem] border relative\">\n                        <button onClick={() => setEditalSubjects(prev => prev.filter(s => s.id !== sub.id))} className=\"absolute top-6 right-6 p-2 text-rose-500\"><Trash2 size={18} /></button>\n                        <input value={sub.name} onChange={(e) => { const n = [...editalSubjects]; n[sIdx].name = e.target.value; setEditalSubjects(n); }} className=\"bg-transparent font-black text-xl outline-none dark:text-white w-full mb-4\" placeholder=\"Nome da Disciplina...\" />\n                        <textarea \n                          placeholder=\"Cole os tópicos, um por linha...\"\n                          className=\"w-full h-40 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 rounded-2xl p-6 outline-none border text-sm font-bold\"\n                          defaultValue={sub.topics.map(t => t.title).join('\\n')}\n                          onBlur={(e) => {\n                            const lines = e.target.value.split('\\n').filter(l => l.trim() !== '');\n                            const newTopics = lines.map(line => ({ id: Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9), title: line.trim(), completed: false, importance: 3, studyTimeMinutes: 0 }));\n                            const n = [...editalSubjects];\n                            n[sIdx].topics = newTopics;\n                            setEditalSubjects(n);\n                          }}\n                        />\n                      </div>\n                    ))}\n                  </div>\n               </div>\n             </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Admin;\n"
            }
          ]
