    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Renaming: \"Membros\" Page**\n\nI'm currently focused on renaming the \"Membros\" page to \"Usuários\" within the study platform. I've pinpointed the necessary updates in `App.tsx` for the navigation label and in `Admin.tsx` to modify the header when viewing users. These are the two primary updates at this stage. I'm moving toward the first required update, in order.\n\n\n",
