    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Considering Connectivity Column**\n\nI'm currently focused on incorporating a connectivity status column into the user management table within the Admin component. The core challenge is integrating the existing `isOnline` property from the `User` type, along with the `last_seen` timestamp from the Supabase `profiles` table to visually represent a user's current status (online/offline). I'm considering the best data structure for presenting this information in a clear and efficient manner within the table.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
