    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Updating Disciplinas Component**\n\nI'm working on the `Disciplinas.tsx` component, focusing on adding new fields to track user performance within each study topic. My goal is to incorporate \"questions attempted,\" \"questions correct,\" and a calculated \"aproveitamento\" (performance percentage). This will provide more detailed insights into a student's progress.\n\n\n**Refining Disciplinas Component**\n\nI'm now focusing on integrating question statistics directly into the topic list and \"Registrar\" modal in `Disciplinas.tsx`. I'll show question stats and the performance percentage in the collapsed view of each topic, and added inputs for questions attempted and correct in the modal. I'm also adding visual indicators, such as color-coded performance indicators for a clearer display. I am sticking to the existing UI aesthetic.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
