      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Envisioning the Design**\n\nI'm now picturing a website, not a mobile app, for this senior full stack and web designer, with a clean, futuristic, and immersive aesthetic. The design leans toward a darker background with a transparent, \"glassmorphic\" style for the menus and boxes, keeping all existing functionalities. I'm focusing on creating a \"site-like\" experience that fixes the usual mobile-app look.\n\n\n**Refining the Layout**\n\nI'm now diving into the code, starting with *index.html* and *App.tsx*. I'm focusing on the overall site structure, replacing the mobile-like sidebar with a more integrated side navigation, reminiscent of web dashboards, and I'm updating the aesthetic in the login screen. Also, I'm adjusting the card layouts in *Dashboard.tsx* to be more spacious. I'm also changing the background with a darker overlay for the whole look.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
