      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Visualizing Progress Flow**\n\nI'm now focusing on a \"Quest Progress\" system for study plans, envisioned as a game-style trail. I'm thinking of \"largada\" and \"chegada\" for the start and end. I'm envisioning a character moving along this trail based on completion percentage. Also, keeping the dark mode/Obsidian glass aesthetic. It's becoming more clear now!\n\n\n**Refining Visual Elements**\n\nI'm now iterating on the visual elements. I've switched from the circular radar to a horizontal or zigzag \"Study Path,\" envisioned as a glowing neon trail in a dark library. Flags, portals, or distinct icons will mark the start and end, and an animated avatar will move along the path based on the progress percentage. I'm focusing on the `StudyTrail` component and its props, specifically the `progress` value to control the avatar's movement. I'm also ensuring character animations are present. I'm checking `App.tsx` for slimming opportunities.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
