    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Updating Admin Design**\n\nOkay, I'm now focused on updating the `Admin` component to fit the \"Obsidian Glass\" aesthetic. My main priority is in transforming `Admin.tsx` to utilize dark backgrounds and glass-like cards. I'm aiming for consistent typography to ensure visual harmony, too. This should match the styling on other pages and improve usability for users. I'm focusing on the component's styling first, then the specific data rendering.\n\n\n",
