    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Focusing on Disciplinas**\n\nI'm zeroing in on the `Disciplinas.tsx` component. My immediate goal is to integrate a \"quick view\" feature for each study topic. This will display key stats like study time, date, questions tackled, and accuracy— essentially a fast summary of performance. My goal is to add a summary for each topic.\n\n\n**Refining Display Details**\n\nI'm now integrating detailed stats into the `Disciplinas.tsx` component. My focus is on concise display within the existing \"Obsidian Glass\" aesthetic. I'm adding a status row to each topic, showing a formatted date for `lastStudiedAt`, `studyTimeMinutes`, and counts for questions attempted and correct. I'm calculating and displaying a percentage for correct answers, using small pills or icons to represent these values. The existing delete confirmation logic remains untouched, and I'm ensuring all additions align with the color scheme.\n\n\n",
