      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Fixing Reset and Delete**\n\nI'm tackling the issues with the \"Reset\" and \"Delete\" buttons in the Disciplines page. They're currently non-functional, as per my assessment. I've also identified and removed some stray characters in the subject cards that were causing UI glitches. My immediate focus is on restoring the proper functionality of these key UI elements, particularly for the \"Reset\" feature, as it's crucial for the user's data entry workflow.\n\n\n**Refining UI Loop and Reset**\n\nI've identified a logic error in the `Disciplinas.tsx` rendering loop, specifically in the `subjects.map` function, which might be causing the issue with the non-functional buttons. I've corrected the loop. I'm also digging into the modal interaction. The Reset function will now zero out fields like `studyTimeMinutes`, `questionsAttempted`, and `revisionsDone`. I'm focusing on cleaning up the loop. I'm now in the process of implementing the `executeReset` function. I'm also styling the Reset button with a `RotateCcw` icon.\n\n\n",
