tton's `onClick` handler. I'm verifying the data passed to confirm the deletion action. Also, I'm checking the logic to confirm proper state changes. I'll make sure there's no unintended side effects.\n\n\n**Analyzing Topic Logic**\n\nI'm now focusing on the logic for adding and managing topics within the inline editing section of `Disciplinas.tsx`. I'm going through the event listeners and the `Topic` object creation. I'm focusing on the state management for `tempEditText`, and the logic that manages inline editing and canceling, especially regarding how the Enter key triggers updates and resets.\n\n\n**Addressing the Check Logic**\n\nI'm now carefully examining the completion status updates for each topic within the subject detail in `Disciplinas.tsx`. I'm verifying the onClick handlers that are used to toggle the completion state. I'm focusing on the logic that generates an updated list of topics after their respective completion status has changed. I want to check that it correctly updates the local state using the new data and then updates the remote data with `handleSubjectUpdate`.\n\n\n**Refining Topic Updates**\n\nI'm now refining the topic updates within the inline editing section of `Disciplinas.tsx`. I'm verifying the Enter key functionality, to update topics. The code appears to correctly map the updated `tempEditText` to the specific topic ID, and handles Escape to cancel changes. Also, I'm analyzing the state management for `tempEditText`.\n\n\n**Refining Functionality**\n\nI'm now carefully checking the `Topic` rendering within the inline editor in `Disciplinas.tsx`. I'm confirming `tempEditText` updates reflect the correct input when editing topic titles, and am checking the enter and escape key bindings. I'm focusing on ensuring changes are properly reflected, and the display transitions smoothly.\n\n\n**Verifying Date Formatting**\n\nI'm now carefully examining the date formatting for `topic.lastStudiedAt` within the `Disciplinas.tsx` component. I'm double-checking the use of `toLocaleDateString('pt-BR')` to ensure it correctly displays the date in the expected Brazilian Portuguese format. I'll also confirm consistent date formatting across the component.\n\n\n**Validating Data Updates**\n\nI'm now carefully checking the `saveTopicProgress` and related state updates in `Disciplinas.tsx`, particularly how they incorporate data for progress metrics and when they're triggered. I'm verifying the data updates and I'm ensuring there are no race conditions or state inconsistencies, and the updates are appropriately reflected. The time, questions, and dates calculations are all working as expected.\n\n\n**Refining UI Interactivity**\n\nI'm now refining the user interface within `Disciplinas.tsx`, focused on interactive elements like the trash button for topic deletion. I'm verifying the button's click handler correctly updates the display of `topics`, and ensures the component renders the expected visual changes in state. I'm paying attention to performance considerations for frequent updates.\n\n\n**Evaluating Date Handling**\n\nI'm now carefully examining date handling, specifically around the `Data da Sessão` input within `Disciplinas.tsx`. I'm focused on how `progDate` is managed, including setting and updating. I'm verifying the date format handling. Also, I'm checking to ensure that any `onChange` events properly update the state, and that the chosen date accurately reflects within the application.\n\n\n**Validating Input Handling**\n\nI'm now carefully examining the input fields within the `Disciplinas.tsx` component, specifically those related to progress tracking: minutes, total questions, and correct answers. I'm focused on validating user input. I'm verifying the `onChange` event handlers and the data type handling to ensure numeric values. I'm also looking into what happens when `setProgMinutes`, `setProgAttempted`, and `setProgCorrect` are triggered.\n\n\n",
