action with the `setDeleteConfirmation` and confirming the behavior linked to `topic.id`, `parentId`, and how it connects to the underlying logic.\n\n\n\n**Validating Progress Data Display**\n\nI'm now investigating how the progress data is displayed within the \"REGISTRAR SESSÃO\" modal. I'm focusing on the input fields and how their values are bound to the state variables. I'm confirming that the data updates correctly and is also cleared correctly, particularly after user interactions like clicking the \"REGISTRAR SESSÃO\" button. I'm going to check the data flow.\n\n\n**Validating Progress Input Binding**\n\nI am now focusing on the data binding within the progress registration form to ensure input values correctly reflect and update the state variables: `progDate`, `progHours`, `progMinutes`, `progAttempted`, and `progCorrect`. I'm reviewing how the `onChange` event handlers work for the date and number inputs to verify data flow. I also want to verify correct variable updating.\n\n\n\n**Verifying Progress Input Binding**\n\nI'm now deeply analyzing the interactions of input fields within the progress registration form. Specifically, I'm checking that numeric inputs for total questions and correct answers update the correct state variables. The data is parsed to ensure numeric values, while handling empty states and potential errors in input. I also need to verify data flow.\n\n\n**Validating UI Data Flow**\n\nI'm now investigating the UI actions and confirm them with data flow and user interaction. I've re-reviewed the modal display and I have also reviewed the 'CANCELAR' button on the delete confirmation modal. I'm focusing on user interactions and state changes that are expected. I'm reviewing to make sure the delete confirmation state correctly handles interactions and the proper component state.\n\n\n**Validating Confirm Button Functionality**\n\nI'm verifying that the reset and delete confirmation modals correctly update the state variables related to the