      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Analyzing the User Interface**\n\nI've got a logged-in Senior Full Stack Developer & Web Designer, but the \"Disciplines/Subjects\" page is showing no data, indicating a 0% progress status. Additionally, the Editais registration page in the Admin section is failing to load, suggesting a broken functionality. My focus is on these interface issues.\n\n\n**Debugging Data Retrieval**\n\nI'm focused on resolving the data loss issue by double-checking the `fetchData` function, especially the `user_id` query, and session handling. I need to make sure `ralysonriccelli@gmail.com`'s login retrieves the correct records linked to their `auth.uid()`. I plan to add debug logs to see what's happening. I'm also confirming the `editais` page is unimplemented in `Admin.tsx`.\n\n\n",
