      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Implementing Study Alerts**\n\nI'm working on the `Disciplinas.tsx` file, specifically adding a notification feature. My plan is to implement a toast or alert message that pops up every time a study log is successfully registered in the database. I'm aiming for quick feedback to the user on these study log submissions.\n\n\n**Refining Toast Implementation**\n\nI've made progress on the `Disciplinas.tsx` file. I've added a `toast` state and am either creating a `Toast` component or adding the logic directly. The plan is to trigger this toast upon the successful insertion of study log data into Supabase, utilizing a success icon and message like \"PROGRESSO SINCRONIZADO\". I'm also implementing a floating badge with a \"Flow\" aesthetic—think indigo/emerald gradients and dark glassmorphism—that will automatically hide after a few seconds. Currently focused on setting the `showToast` state within `saveTopicProgress`.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
