      "text": "**Locating the Target**\n\nI've pinpointed `Dashboard.tsx` as the initial target, specifically for date insertion. However, I realized \"Acesso Privado Ativo\" resides in the `header` component within `App.tsx`. Therefore, I'll shift my focus and analyze `App.tsx` to understand the current structure and how to best integrate the date element.\n\n\n**Refining the Approach**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on integrating the daily motivational phrase and date display within `App.tsx` and `Dashboard.tsx`. I've confirmed that the \"Acesso Privado Ativo\" text sits within the `header` of `App.tsx`, and will place the date near the `Lock` icon. My current focus is to develop a list of motivational phrases, and implement logic to dynamically select one daily using a modulo operator with the day of the year. I also want to render this phrase above \"Trilha da Nomeação\". Also, that date issue is fixed.\n\n\n",
