      "text": "**Rebuilding User Management**\n\nI'm focused on the user management page, specifically fixing those broken edit and delete buttons. The priority is getting the detailed user list view restored, including name, email, access level, and status (active, suspended, blocked), as well as connectivity and actions.\n\n\n**Enhancing User Table**\n\nI'm now diving into the specifics of the user table within `Admin.tsx`. I'm working to make the data display clearly, using color-coded badges for status and a pulse dot for online/offline connectivity. I'm also implementing the functionality for the edit and delete buttons, ensuring confirmation for deletion and a modal for editing user details. Plus, I need to make sure the search functionality remains intact.\n\n\n",
