      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Refining The Weekly Count**\n\nI'm currently focused on the \"Meta Semanal\" card. I'm modifying the dashboard logic to reset the weekly study log count every Sunday night at midnight. Simultaneously, I'm working to ensure that the sum accurately reflects only study logs recorded during the current week, Monday through Sunday.\n\n\n**Adjusting Week Start Date**\n\nI realized the week calculation in `Dashboard.tsx` needs a tweak. The existing `getDay()` logic was causing Sundays to be incorrectly calculated. I've updated the week start date computation to align with the ISO-8601 standard, where Monday is the start of the week. Now, I have a new calculation which correctly adjusts for Mondays, ensuring that the weekly count begins on the correct day. I'm satisfied with this logic.\n\n\n**Confirming Logic and UI**\n\nI'm now completely confident in the Monday calculation. The formula `(day + 6) % 7` works, as the formula and examples have shown. I've updated the `thisWeekHours` `useMemo` in `Dashboard.tsx` to reflect this logic. Now, I have to ensure visual consistency, and double check that the UI elements clearly reflect \"Meta Semanal\" for the current week. Also, I must ensure that study logs are summed only in the period from Monday through Sunday. Finally, I confirmed the `StudySession` date comparison in `types.ts` is solid.\n\n\n",
