      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Analyzing Ciclos Functionality**\n\nI'm currently focused on the \"Ciclos\" page and the need to implement a delete functionality for study cycle plans. I'm leaning toward adding a \"Delete\" button. I'm exploring the implications for user experience and data integrity, and I'll need to consider confirmation prompts and data management best practices.\n\n\n**Implementing Delete Functionality**\n\nI've made progress on the \"Ciclos\" page. I'm adding a confirmation alert before deletion, similar to the one used elsewhere. The function will delete the record from the study cycle table in Supabase. It will also update the local state to nullify the current cycle and clear other relevant states like `configSubjects`. The \"Clear/Delete Plan\" button will be placed in the \"Matriz Operacional\" section or near the indicator cards.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
