      "text": "**Addressing Component Functionality**\n\nI'm currently focused on the `components/Ciclos.tsx` component. The key point is the automatic saving feature; users may appreciate a dedicated \"save/generate\" button for clarity. I'm investigating how this can be seamlessly implemented without disrupting the current auto-save behavior.\n\n\n**Adding Daily Study Time**\n\nI've made headway on the \"Daily Study Time\" field. I've added the `hoursPerDay` state and linked it to the `StudyCycle` type and the `saveCycleState` function, as you can see, I've added an input field for it below \"Disciplinas por Ciclo\". The important thing now is ensuring the UI maintains the Master UI aesthetic, including the typography. The current typography is specified as `text-[9px] font-black uppercase text-slate-500`.\n\n\n",
