      "text": "**Designing the Database Schema**\n\nI'm now focused on the foundational database schema for `Ciclos.tsx`. My current task is to generate the appropriate SQL script for Supabase, ensuring that the database structure perfectly aligns with the component's functionality. The primary focus is defining the table structure with correct data types, starting with the `id` column as an `int8`.\n\n\n**Refining the Schema Structure**\n\nI'm now integrating the additional `num_ciclos` column into the schema. I'm also ensuring that RLS (Row Level Security) is correctly defined. I've re-reviewed the user-provided columns to guarantee everything is accounted for. I'm focusing on aligning the column names, such as `hour_per_day` and `meta_atual`, across the schema and persistence logic. I'm ensuring consistency with the `saveCycleState` function.\n\n\n**Updating the Data Model**\n\nI'm now integrating optimistic updates for the \"checked\" status within the UI. I've updated the SQL script to include a check for the existence of `num_ciclos`, and have implemented the addition if required, along with appropriate RLS considerations. I'm aligning the fetch and save logic in the React component to read from and write to the updated columns. I'm also addressing the column name consistency between the UI and database, considering `hour_per_day` and `meta_atual`. I need to ensure `saveCycleState` utilizes precise schema keys.\n\n\n",
