  {
    "id": 974,
    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Updating Nomenclature Progress**\n\nI'm currently focused on the \"Ciclos\" page, specifically the `Ciclos.tsx` component. The primary goal is nomenclature updates, starting with replacing \"setores\" with \"ciclos.\" I've begun to implement this change, aiming for a consistent style like \"Ciclo 01,\" \"Ciclo 02,\" etc. I'm taking care to ensure it doesn't affect the rest of the app!\n\n\n**Refining Terminology Consistency**\n\nI'm now changing the HUD text, cycle card headers, titles, and button labels within `Ciclos.tsx` to ensure consistent \"Ciclo\" nomenclature. Specifically, \"Fase em Execução\" is now \"Ciclo em Execução\" on the HUD card, and \"Setor\" references are replaced with \"Ciclo\" throughout, maintaining the established pattern. I'm also confirming the logic is sound and the component remains robust and synced with Supabase. Lastly, I'm maintaining the UI's high-end design, like glassmorphism and neon borders.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
    },
    "createdTimestamp": {
