  {
    "id": 983,
    "author": "model",
    "payload": {
      "type": "thinking",
      "text": "**Refactoring Page Layout**\n\nI'm currently working on refactoring the \"Ciclos\" page. My latest focus is on repositioning the \"Matriz de Configuração.\" I plan to move it from its current sidebar position (`lg:col-span-4`) below the cycle cards, which are positioned on the right (`lg:col`). This shift aims to improve the page's overall visual flow.\n\n\n**Re-prioritizing Page Elements**\n\nI've decided to prioritize the ongoing cycles, so I'm shifting the Tactical Panel below the Cycles Visualization. The grid layout is being abandoned in favor of a vertical stack. The HUD at the top will remain. The main area will now be the Cycles Visualization at the top, taking full width. The Config Panel will follow below, also full width, or with a centered, constrained width for large screens. A vertical gap or heading will separate them.\n\n\n",
      "cMarkNode": {}
    },
